  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-F.S. for Establishing a Natural Gas Transmission and Distribution Network Between GCC Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pre_feasibility study aims at identifying the viability of conducting a detailed feasibility study prior to the project&apos;s promotion and execution. The study will benefit in the identification of those project components that require special focus, or the need for any supporting studies while conducting the detailed feasibility study. Once  completed, this pre_feasibility study will be used for the promotion and establishment of a private company that will execute the gas network project.</narrative>
  </description>
